---
import EventLedger from '../components/EventLedger.astro';
import CounterCode from '../components/CounterCode.astro';
import command from '../examples/counter-command.hs?raw';
import decision from '../examples/counter-decision.hs?raw';
import event from '../examples/counter-event.hs?raw';
import entity from '../examples/counter-entity.hs?raw';
import update from '../examples/counter-update.hs?raw';
import query from '../examples/counter-query.hs?raw';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import VisitorContext from '../components/VisitorContext.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';

const counterSource = 'https://github.com/neohaskell/NeoHaskell/tree/cacc8069070721539ae0aac53286ce9492e906a5/neo/starter';
const querySource = 'https://github.com/neohaskell/NeoHaskell/blob/cacc8069070721539ae0aac53286ce9492e906a5/neo/starter/src/Starter/Counter/Queries/CounterView.hs';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="NeoHaskell is an AI-first language for applications with clear behavior and recorded history. Build with your agent. Understand what you build." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1c062d" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://neohaskell.org/" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/logo.svg" />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/sansation.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/manrope.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <meta property="og:title" content="NeoHaskell: Build with AI. Know what you build." />
    <meta property="og:description" content="An AI-first language for applications with clear behavior and recorded history. Explore the model, agent skills, and application starter." />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://neohaskell.org/" />
    <title>NeoHaskell: Build with AI. Know what you build.</title>
    <script is:inline>
      (() => {
        let preference;
        try { preference = localStorage.getItem('starlight-theme'); } catch {}
        const theme = preference === 'light' || preference === 'dark' ? preference : matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: light)').matches ? 'light' : 'dark';
        document.documentElement.dataset.theme = theme;
        document.querySelector('meta[name="theme-color"]').content = theme === 'light' ? '#fafafc' : '#1c062d';
      })();
    </script>
    <VisitorContext />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="site-shell">
      <header class="site-header">
        <a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="NeoHaskell home"><img src="/logo.svg" width="43" height="43" alt="" /><span>NeoHaskell</span></a>
        <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/learn/" class="nav-guide"><span class="nav-label-full">Documentation</span><span class="nav-label-short">Docs</span></a>
          <a href="/resources/" class="nav-resources">Resources</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/neohaskell/NeoHaskell" class="github-link">GitHub<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 15 15 5M5 5h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a>
        </nav>
        <button class="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Switch color theme" title="Switch color theme">
          <svg class="sun-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2m0 16v2M2 12h2m16 0h2M5 5l1.5 1.5m11 11L19 19M5 19l1.5-1.5m11-11L19 5"/></svg>
          <svg class="moon-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 15.5A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8.5 4 8.5 8.5 0 1 0 20 15.5Z"/></svg>
        </button>
      </header>
      <main id="main">
        <section class="opening" aria-labelledby="headline">
          <h1 id="headline"><span class="headline-line">Build with AI</span><span class="headline-line">Know what <span class="headline-ending">you <span class="pixel-word">build</span></span></span></h1>
          <div class="hero-support">
            <p class="hero-description">An AI-first language for applications with clear behavior, recorded history, and changes you can follow.</p>
            <a href="/learn/" class="primary-link">Learn the concepts<Arrow /></a>
          </div>
          <EventLedger />
        </section>
        <section class="counter-section" id="see-the-code" aria-labelledby="command-title">
          <div class="counter-intro">
            <h2 id="command-title">Accept a change</h2>
            <div>
              <p>Start with the <a href={counterSource}>Counter starter</a> and its HTTP server. These simplified definitions handle <code>POST /commands/increment-counter</code> for an existing counter.</p>
              <p>The decision accepts positive amounts and records an event. The <a href="https://github.com/neohaskell/NeoHaskell/blob/cacc8069070721539ae0aac53286ce9492e906a5/neo/starter/tests/Decider/Counter/IncrementCounterSpec.hs">starter’s tests cover accepted and rejected commands</a>.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="counter-snippets counter-write">
            <CounterCode code={command} name="command" label="IncrementCounter command" />
            <CounterCode code={decision} name="decision" label="Counter decision" />
            <CounterCode code={event} name="event" label="CounterIncremented event payload" />
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="counter-section counter-read" id="read-the-counter" aria-labelledby="query-title">
          <div class="counter-intro">
            <h2 id="query-title">Build the current answer</h2>
            <div>
              <p>Apply each increment to the counter’s value. The entity holds the current state, rebuilt from <a href="https://github.com/neohaskell/NeoHaskell/blob/cacc8069070721539ae0aac53286ce9492e906a5/neo/starter/tests/Property/CounterReplaySpec.hs">recorded events</a>.</p>
              <p>The <a href={querySource}>CounterView query</a> projects that state into a response at <code>GET /queries/counter-view</code>.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="counter-snippets counter-read-code">
            <CounterCode code={entity} name="entity" label="Counter entity" />
            <CounterCode code={update} name="update" label="Counter increment update" />
            <CounterCode code={query} name="query" label="CounterView query" />
          </div>
          <a href="/learn/" class="text-link">Learn the concepts<Arrow /></a>
        </section>
        <section class="evidence-section" aria-labelledby="evidence-title">
          <div class="evidence-intro">
            <h2 id="evidence-title">Build with your agent</h2>
            <p>Published agent instructions and an application starter, with checks you can inspect.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="evidence-items">
            <article>
              <h3>Agent workflow</h3>
              <p><a href="https://github.com/neohaskell/skills/blob/0ff0872d554e79d955f4c92f9b905056b908e9ae/skills/neohaskell-feature-pipeline/SKILL.md">Skills for Claude Code and Codex</a> guide a feature through its behavior, backend, API client, frontend, and verification.</p>
              <a class="text-link" href="/getting-started/">Set up your agent<Arrow /></a>
            </article>
            <article>
              <h3>Counter starter</h3>
              <p>The Counter application connects <a href="/resources/#language-and-framework">commands, recorded events, and a query</a>. Its tests cover rejected inputs, history replay, and an HTTP workflow.</p>
              <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/neohaskell/NeoHaskell/tree/cacc8069070721539ae0aac53286ce9492e906a5/neo/starter">Explore the starter<Arrow /></a>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="community-section" aria-labelledby="community-title">
          <div class="community-intro">
            <h2 id="community-title">Built in the open</h2>
            <p>NeoHaskell is under active development. Explore what’s being built, ask questions, and help shape what comes next.</p>
            <p><a href="https://github.com/neohaskell/NeoHaskell/releases/tag/neo-v0.17.1">Neo CLI &amp; framework 0.17.1</a> adds owned file storage for generated documents. <a href="https://github.com/neohaskell/NeoHaskell/releases">Read the release history</a>.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="community-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/neohaskell/NeoHaskell"><strong>GitHub</strong><Arrow /></a>
            <a href="https://discord.com/invite/wDj3UYzec8"><strong>Discord</strong><Arrow /></a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
      <footer class="site-footer"><a href="/" class="footer-brand">NeoHaskell</a><nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href="/learn/">Documentation</a><a href="/resources/">Resources</a><a href="https://github.com/neohaskell/NeoHaskell">GitHub</a><a href="https://discord.com/invite/wDj3UYzec8">Discord</a></nav></footer>
    </div>
    <script>
      const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.theme-toggle');
      const root = document.documentElement;
      const updateLabel = () => {
        const target = root.dataset.theme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';
        button?.setAttribute('aria-label', `Switch to ${target} theme`);
        button?.setAttribute('title', `Switch to ${target} theme`);
        document.querySelector('meta[name="theme-color"]')?.setAttribute('content', target === 'light' ? '#1c062d' : '#fafafc');
      };
      button?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const theme = root.dataset.theme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';
        root.dataset.theme = theme;
        try { localStorage.setItem('starlight-theme', theme); } catch {}
        updateLabel();
      });
      matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: light)').addEventListener('change', (event) => {
        let preference;
        try { preference = localStorage.getItem('starlight-theme'); } catch {}
        if (preference !== 'light' && preference !== 'dark') { root.dataset.theme = event.matches ? 'light' : 'dark'; updateLabel(); }
      });
      updateLabel();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
